"It installs, updates and removes packages, switches the mirror and adds "
"repositories. It asks for authorisation through polkit before it changes "
"anything."
msgstr ""
"Ele instala, atualiza e remove pacotes, troca o espelho e adiciona "
"repositórios. Pede autorização pelo polkit antes de mudar qualquer coisa."

#: kxbps-qt/qml/views/HelpView.qml:55
msgid ""
"It opens when a transaction starts. The button in the status strip opens and "
"closes it, and the top edge can be dragged to resize."
